WEBVTT

00:42:57.510 --> 00:43:00.826
Kate Sweeny and Michael Dooley
on worrying versus rumination,

00:43:00.850 --> 00:43:03.576
Constantine Sedikides
and colleagues on nostalgia,

00:43:03.600 --> 00:43:06.124
Laura Kray and colleagues
on counterfactual thinking,

00:43:06.148 --> 00:43:08.726
Emily Bianchi on starting
your career in a recession,

00:43:08.750 --> 00:43:12.069
and my late advisor, Richard Hackman,
on teams as amplifiers.

00:43:12.930 --> 00:43:14.448
For all their help this season,

00:43:14.472 --> 00:43:17.006
we thank Nicole Bode,
Valentina Bojanini,

00:43:17.030 --> 00:43:19.036
Sammy Case, Micah Eames,

00:43:19.060 --> 00:43:21.046
Will Hennessy, Dian Lofton,

00:43:21.070 --> 00:43:24.720
Jen Michalski, Sarah Jane Souther
and Emma Taubner.

00:43:26.010 --> 00:43:28.506
That's a wrap for season three
of "WorkLife."

00:43:28.530 --> 00:43:30.326
Thank you so much for joining us.